{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3192","id":3533529800,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887SnWLI","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3192","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3192.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3192.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3192","number":3192,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"policy: include CapGrant destinations for peer relay capabilities","user":{"login":"wangrzneu","id":3406517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDY1MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3406517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu","html_url":"https://github.com/wangrzneu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Changes\r\nExtend MatchFromFilterRule in hscontrol/policy/matcher/matcher.go to union CapGrant[].Dsts into the rule's destination set. Without this, a node that only receives capabilities (e.g. cap/relay, cap/relay-target) through a CapGrant is excluded from the grant issuer's peer map, which breaks peer relay on grant-only policies.\r\nClose: https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2841  \r\n\r\n# Peer Relay Test Method and Results\r\n## Method\r\n  - Objective: verify in a real environment that 100.64.0.2 and 100.64.0.4 can use peer relay through 100.64.0.3 when direct UDP connectivity is\r\n    blocked.\r\n  - Environment:\r\n      - 100.64.0.2: headscale-server on 107.150.110.155\r\n      - 100.64.0.3: relay node on 123.58.213.16 / 10-7-54-172\r\n      - 100.64.0.4: client node on 10-60-53-172\r\n      - Headscale was upgraded to the current branch build before testing.\r\n  - Method:\r\n      - Verified the baseline path was direct.\r\n      - Added temporary iptables rules on both ends to block UDP 41641 between 0.2 and 0.4.\r\n      - Configured the relay node to listen on 40000 and advertise 123.58.213.16:40000.\r\n      - Re-tested with tailscale ping, tailscale status, and tailscale debug peer-relay-sessions.\r\n      - Removed the temporary firewall rules after the test.\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\n  - Direct connectivity was successfully forced off.\r\n  - Both directions switched to peer relay:\r\n      - 0.2 -> 0.4: via peer-relay(123.58.213.16:40000:vni:1)\r\n      - 0.4 -> 0.2: via peer-relay(10.7.54.172:40000:vni:1)\r\n  - On the relay node, tailscale debug peer-relay-sessions showed an active session and increasing packet counts.\r\n  - After removing the temporary blocks, the nodes returned to direct connectivity.\r\n\r\n  Conclusion\r\n\r\n  - Real-world end-to-end peer relay is working.\r\n\r\n# Check List\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [x] added integration tests\r\n- [x] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n ","created_at":"2026-04-15T11:20:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T19:12:36Z","closed_at":"2026-05-12T19:12:35Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith